# NOTE: everything in data/processed/ is intentionally TRACKED.
# Predicted_Scores.csv is fetched by the Power BI dashboard from a GitHub raw
# URL, so it must stay committed and pushed for the dashboard to see fresh
# predictions. The *_Enriched.csv files are tracked so a fresh clone can train
# the model without re-running a full API enrichment pass.
